            "review_text": "AngryPandas\nLondon, United Kingdom6 contributions\n0\nOK food, poor service\nApr 2014 • Couples\nRestaurant is around the corner from the War Remnants museum and looks nice enough from the outside. Sat on the porch overlooking the road, which was a mistake as they rarely seemed to bother coming out to take orders or to ask them for the bill. Had to go inside to find someone to pay and was roundly ignored (along with another couple trying to do the same) for 10 minutes. Once we finally had their attention, we had to wait a further 5 minutes while they hand wrote a receipt due to a broken printer... Service charge was automatically added but was removed upon request. A 10% tax was also added to the bill... Food itself was OK, nothing spectacular but did the job if a little expensive for what it was.\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2014",
            "rating": 5.0,
