            "review_text": "Su_molloy\nDublin, Ireland8 contributions\n0\nWould avoid if possible.\nI visited this restaurant with a group before we went to the war remnant museum. Food was quite good but the dead cockroaches on the floor And live ones spotted on the wall were quite offputting. We could have ignored that had everything else been better. When it came to paying, we paid individually...the waiter added the 15% to each item separately and some of the group ended up paying different amounts for the same thing. After we'd paid and left to get tickets for the museum, he followed us to the ticket office saying that we hadn't paid for one rice dish, which we had in fact paid for. It was a very unpleasant experience and I wouldn't recommend any groups to go there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 24, 2012",
